SM-T715 tablet: the Rotate tile.

Adds Rotate, a quarter turn by hand through t715-rotate (in the root image),
next to Rotation (upstream's rotation lock, over omamobile-autorotate.service,
which the image's unit runs as t715-rotate). The sheet closes first, so the
turn is not of the sheet; the lock's state is read again after the turn.
The SM-T715's 0.2.94 series' 0005-tablet-rotation, rebased. Against
omarchy-mobile 8991845 (omamobile-shell 0.2.147), after 0001-0004.

